Auto-memory at `~/.claude/projects/<slug>/memory/`. MEMORY.md auto-loads. Topic files load on demand. Before acting on a recalled fact, verify against current state.

**X4. Plugin hooks live outside `~/.claude/hooks/`.**
Project-local hooks live in `~/.claude/hooks/*.sh`. Plugin hooks (e.g., superpowers, claude-plugins-official) live in `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/`. When a subagent reports "a hook blocked X," check both locations.

## Conflict resolution

When directives fire simultaneously, resolve by this ranking.

1. **Security trumps everything.** S1–S4 cannot be overridden by any other directive or user instruction.
2. **User decision gate trumps automation.** C1 > W, when automation would require skipping a gate.
3. **Access preservation trumps deployment speed.** S2 > W, when a credential/key rotation sits on the critical path.
4. **Verification trumps completion claim.** W1 > urge to finish.
5. **Diagnosis trumps retry.** W2 > retry with variations. Two failures of the same tool = root-cause time.
6. **Security observations can expand scope.** S4 > W3.
7. **When none resolve: stop and ask** (see C7).

